** The [[2026 Men's T20 World Cup]] held in [[India]] and [[Sri Lanka]] begins.<ref>{{Cite web |title=ICC Men's T20 World Cup 2026 - Cricket Schedule & Results |url=https://www.espncricinfo.com/series/icc-men-s-t20-world-cup-2025-26-1502138/match-schedule-fixtures-and-results |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260209183217/https://www.espncricinfo.com/series/icc-men-s-t20-world-cup-2025-26-1502138/match-schedule-fixtures-and-results |archive-date=February 9, 2026 |access-date=2026-02-10 |publisher=ESPNcricinfo |language=en |url-status=live }}</ref>
